<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 TASALONIKIYAYA</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tasalonikaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tasalonikaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Tasalonikaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">1Tasalonikaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">1Tasalonikaya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗa ɓa ya a har nda Mbulus, tǝ Sila, tǝ Timoti. Chireethleng nandan a fatakkwaya Yeeso ɗǝ na a Tasalonika a nafiya Faara na Chinɗi tǝ Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. Ngwa tsauka nggayirha tǝ tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ kun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tar Fathlǝngya 17:1 </char></note><verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝr ƙǝkafekkid Tasaonikiyaya tǝ tur tsawud ndan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Nan naarha usa Faara ƙǝsǝr ka kun heu, nan naarha ƙǝm hwanang Faara kun teena ƙǝtsar. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />A naɗan a hwan Faara aten nun nan ɗal teena hai tǝ tar fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun nanun tǝghǝn a mbed Faara Chinǝm, tǝ ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ nanun tǝghǝn hu nggǝmnda, tǝ ƙǝrǝsta ƙǝsǝr ka shiteena nanun tǝghǝn aten Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Sǝnɗansǝ Shayina, nggǝmna Faara kun wurnǝn kun a tsawun nafighǝn. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ɓang ɗan Laɓaara kun ɓa na Mbǝnggǝn, mbǝ laɓaara katenggǝn wa, amma tǝ sǝsǝmnda, tǝ Sǝsǝna Tǝ Peɗǝnda pǝrangga ƙǝkafek kun. Sǝnɗun tur tsawud nan ǝna nan tǝ kun ka a thlar kun nan. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Tsauɗun nafiya tsahagha tǝ kan, tǝ ƙǝm Chinǝm, thlǝ laɓar Faara nun tǝ wutsǝfayirha fǝrna Sǝsǝna Tǝpeɗǝnda, ko nanǝn sǝsaa ɗun kaan. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ƙǝsǝr ka kee tsauɗun ǝn sakhrha a fa takkwaya heu na a chehweed Makidoniya tǝ Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Nanǝnya laɓar Faara wel ɗa ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ka kun mbǝ a chehweed Makidoniya tǝ Akaya kee wa, amma fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun a Faara sǝk fiya ndǝn ko a yanggi ni. Tsaunǝn kee, mbǝ minnan sǝ kalang sǝ a tenggǝn wa. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ƙǝsǝr fiya ni tafad ndan na a thlǝk laɓar thlǝn nan fa ǝna nun, tǝ ƙǝm ndǝghǝn nun hai tǝ tar ɗaharha, kyakhrun thlǝmad Faara ɓa, ka a tǝrang shilee nun Faara ǝn na tǝ yibrha tǝ ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Nun naarha ƙǝla ɓad Wanggǝn fa ɓa a talara hai. Faara ndǝn thlengga Wan ɗa sǝ ahu mǝrya, ndǝna Yeeso ndǝghǝn ni na a thlang ƙǝm sǝ ahu sǝbrha hur Faara na ɓayi.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Tar Mbulus a Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Shayina, kun tafad nun sǝnɗunsǝ ɓad nan thlǝmad nun ɓa tsauka mere wa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ƙǝla sǝnnunsǝ tǝk ɗan sǝsaarha fa a Filibi. Amma fǝrang Faara kaali kan na a pǝrang Laɓar ɗa nan kun na Mbǝnggǝn atenggǝn, ko nanǝn kar fiya laɓarghǝn fa. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ƙǝsǝr laɓar ɗi pǝrang kun mbǝ nggaɓarha sǝ wa, nduwa mbǝlfeerha, nduwa hukrha wa. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />A meyedghǝn nan narha pǝr ˈya na mid Faara, ƙǝsǝr ƙǝlang ɗǝ kan kam ɗan a pǝr Laɓaara nan na Mbǝnggǝn, mbǝ ka a mbǝnanggǝn fiya wa, amma Faara ndǝghǝn na a ƙǝƙǝrang nda hur nǝm. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />ˈWawan thlǝk laɓar yi mbǝnda mee ka a lǝm kun nan kee wa, tǝ ƙǝm mban tǝ numad suna ahur nan wa. Faara ndǝna shedawan nan. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Mban a kaɗa faala a fad fiya wa, mbǝ a fad nun wa, kala ko wunni. A ndam na minnan sǝ kee, ƙǝla nanan fa fathlǝngya Ƙǝrǝsti kam kaɗa ɗan thlaara a har nun. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />A meyedghǝn nǝghǝm ƙǝla wundakhnaya ahur nun, ƙǝla na maana ƙǝr wanggighǝn. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ƙǝsǝr nggǝm ɗan kun kaan mbǝ ka a pǝrang Laɓar Faara nan kun na Mbǝnggǝn kee wa, amma heu tǝ yiɓǝd nan ƙǝm. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Shayina, ɗalama teena hai tǝ taara ǝna nan. Əna ɗan taara nda fǝɗikrha tǝ yanfara amawa nan sǝsang kun a sayidɗi nan a pǝrang laɓar Faara na mbǝnggǝn kyagha ɓa ahu thlǝm Faara. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Naɗun ǝnɗi nan a ǝnaarha, Faara ƙǝm wai kee, nanan chahal, tǝ nggayirha, tǝ ƙǝkafekkirha ahu ǝn ǝnan nan a kun fa fǝrƙǝkafekkya. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Sǝnɗunsǝ ǝnang ɗan ǝngya kun heu kamngga, ƙǝla na china ǝnang nda wanggighǝn. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Hwan ɗan kun, fǝrang kaali nan kun, tǝ nggab kun nan, na a tsawun ahu kwamana na mǝmǝl a mbed Faara, ndǝghǝn ni aagha kun ahu kutǝryidghǝn ɗǝ tǝ mamnggidghǝn. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Tsaunǝn kee, malang ngwan usa Faara ƙǝsǝr fǝr ɗun ƙǝkafek tǝ laɓar Faara pǝrang nan kun. Laɓarɗi yi Faarani mbǝ yi niifa ni wa. Thlǝwun ndǝn tǝ ndaarha laɓar Faara ni, nanǝnya nǝghǝn a ǝna taara ahur nun. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Kun shayina tsahama nafiya na a takkwa Faara hu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, na hu chehweed Yahudiya, ƙǝsǝr sǝsaɗun ahar nafiya chehweed nun, ƙǝla sǝsa nanda ahar Yahudaya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tar fathlǝngya 17:5</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Yahudaya ni ɓǝlangga Chinǝm Yeeso tǝ annabiya, kanda ni ƙǝm rǝkka kan. Na nda naarha sǝɓang hur Faara ɗǝ kaan, tǝ ƙǝm na nda kar kowunni fa! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tar fathlǝngya 9:23,28, 13:45,50, 14:2,5,19, 17:5,13 18:12 </char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Na nda karang kan fa a pǝrang laɓar Faara nan fingya mbuwa wa Yahudaya, ƙǝsǝr amawa nda wal hǝrǝkrha. Ahu ǝnaarha kiya na nda chik kyarha hu ɗimiyirha hai. A kwasamadghǝn sǝb hur Faara ɗǝ kaan tǝ kanda.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na mid Mbulus sǝ a nggǝrghǝn weng tala Tasalonikaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Kun shayina, akwasamadɗi tsakh nǝm hai, na tennan tekh tǝ kun habɓa ɗan na a nggǝrghan wutta thlǝmad nun ɗǝ, a nggǝrghǝm ƙǝmarha hai na ndan nǝm. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa na minnan sǝ a wuɗan thlǝmad nun ɗǝ, nggi na Mbulus, na minna sǝ a nggǝr yi ɗǝrha ɗǝ saara hangga, amma ƙǝse Sheetan hai. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Akwasamadghǝn heu mani ǝn shiiten nan tǝ wutsǝfayid nan, tǝ ƙǝm tallǝ nan a mbed Chinǝm a wudɗa ɓa, mbǝ kunni wa? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ƙǝkafek kunni ǝn tallǝ nan tǝ wutsǝfayid nan.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nanǝn kee mbang ngwa nan ƙǝrǝsta, ndan kamɗǝ a mal kanda a Atina katen nan. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Thlǝn ɗan Timoti pashid nan hu tar Faara a thlǝmad nun ɗǝ ka a fǝrang kaali nǝn kun ahu fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />amana sǝsadɗi kyakhrang huten nun hai. Kun tafad nun sǝnɗunsǝ nǝm a tǝk sǝsaarha fa, <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />A sayidɗi nanan tǝ kun ˈwa ɗan pǝranggǝn kun tǝ ndaarha, nǝm a tǝk sǝsaarha fa. Tsauɗǝ kee ƙǝla sǝnnunsǝ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Nanǝn kee, mbang ngwa ni ƙǝrǝsta, ndǝn thlǝn ni Timoti a sǝk laɓar fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun ni. Tǝrǝm ɗi nǝn ɗǝ narha tǝ thlǝrɓudɗi, Sheetan huk ɗǝ kun, tsauka tar nan mere. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Amma nanǝnya wudna Timoti a thlǝmad nan ɓa ɓang ɗǝ laɓaara kan ɓa na mbǝnggǝn aten fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun tǝ nggǝm ndan. Nggǝrghǝn ndang nda kan nuwun a ɗal teena hai tǝ kan ƙǝtsar, tǝ ƙǝm nǝghǝn a kukwasang kun fa a na kan nan ƙǝla na mid nan ƙǝm a na kun nan. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nanǝn kee shayina, ahu sǝsad nǝm tǝ ƙǝtǝllǝ nǝm fa wal ɗǝm kaali ƙǝsǝr ish ɗun ngga hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Nanǝnya nǝm a nggǝr chik wal shembe tsaunǝn ish ɗun ngga hu Chinǝm. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Tur yanggi usaayi nan a ǝnang nda Faara ka kun, ka wutsǝfayirha nanǝm tǝghǝn aten yinǝm Faara ka kun? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Nda yanfara tǝ fǝɗikrha nan naarha hwan Faara na a nggǝrghan na kun na a ɗang nggan kun sǝ tǝna fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun chikrha. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Ngwa tangsangga Faara na Chinɗi tǝ Chinǝm Yeeso kwamana ɗǝ na a ɗan wal kun. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Ngwa chighangga Chinǝm hur nggǝm ndan kun tǝ fiya heu ƙǝla nanan tǝghǝn a kun. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />A fǝrangga Chinǝm ƙǝrǝsta kun, tǝnun narha chahal kula ǝn ˈyaara a mbed Faara na Chinɗi. Ngwa tsauka kee a sayidɗi na Chinǝm Yeeso a wutta ɓa tǝ nafiyighǝn heu na chahal.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Tur tsawudɗi na mid Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />A mii ngwaladghǝn shayina, nan a hwan kun, nan ƙǝm a ƙǝs thlǝmad nun ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso tǝ ndaarha, tsawama hu kwamana na mǝmǝl na a mbǝnanggǝn Faara, ƙǝla tsahang nan kun ha. Ko nanǝn nuwun tǝ tsaurha kee, amma nan a fǝrang kaali kun na a nggǝr wun chikƙǝn. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗun ǝnggini tsahang nan kun ha tǝ ngyahad Chinǝm Yeeso. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Tsaunǝn kee, ˈya na mid Faara a tsawun chahal, nama inggun ma kulafayirha. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Kowunni ahur nun sǝn kwaman ɗa nǝn na a ƙǝs altenggǝn tǝnǝn nagha chahal tǝ mamnggirha, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />kula suna naarha ahur nun non ƙǝla nafiya sǝngwa wa Faara wa. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Atam niifa huk shadghǝn tǝtakkwarha nduwa sǝɓanggǝn hurghǝn ɗǝ kaɗa nukkun nǝn wa, ƙǝsǝr na Chinǝm a ngwang kumarha tur ǝnggina sǝ ya, ƙǝla pǝrang nan kun a katǝradghǝn ƙǝs nan thlǝmad nun. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Aawa Faara ƙǝm a tsawum kula naarha chahal wa, amma a nam chahal. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Tsaunǝn kee, kala niifa kargha tsahadɗa fa ya, mbǝ kar nǝn niifa fa wa, amma Faara ndǝn kar nǝn, ndǝghǝn fǝrang Sǝsǝnggǝn kun Tǝpeɗǝnda. <verse eid="1TH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Aten nggǝm ndan, kamngwa a nggǝrghan chireethleng nda kun ɗǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr kun tafad nun tsahang Faara ndǝn kun ha tǝ ndaarha, nggǝmama ndan. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ƙǝkafek, nuwun a nggǝm shayi nun heu na a chehweed Makidoniya. Nanǝn kee na minnan sǝ a chik ɗǝrha nun mbeeɗǝ tǝ nggǝm ndan. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ɗǝfaman ƙǝs alten nun a mbee, nun narha ǝna tarɗi na a mbed nunya tǝƙǝm nama a ǝna taara tǝ haryi nun ƙǝla pǝrang nan kun. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />A naɗun a ǝnaarha kiya nafiya mbuwa wa Ƙǝrǝstaya, na nda fǝrang mamnggirha kun tǝƙǝm a mbǝrsa ɗun tǝ niifa wa.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wutta Chinǝm ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Amma shayina, mbǝ minnan sǝ a tsawun tǝ yamid sǝnda aten fingya mǝrgha wa, nanǝn kee, naɗǝ hur nun sǝbrha ɗǝ ƙǝla fingya mbuwa tǝ shiteena. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝtǝm fǝr ɗǝm ƙǝkafek mǝr Yeeso, nggǝr ɗǝ thliirha sǝ, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗǝmsǝ ngga a wudɗaɓa, na Faara a thleng fingya yina sǝ tǝ yibrha mǝrgha fǝrgha ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Nan a pǝranggǝn kun ƙǝla ndaana tsahad Chinǝm Yeeso, ƙǝm ɓalgha tǝ yibrha fa a fara na Chinǝm ɓarha ɓa, mbǝm ˈwa thliirha ma fingya ˈwagha mǝra wa. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ƙǝsǝr Chinǝm tafadghǝn nǝn a tǝra hai a talara, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ nagha a aah farha, tǝ urad tǝthlǝnda Faara na manggǝn, tǝ pii kodwomnda yi aah Faara. Fingya mǝrgha fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ Yeeso kanda ni na ˈwa thliirha sǝ. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Tǝrgha ƙǝm ɓalgha tǝ yibrha fa, na nda a tǝrang ƙǝm ɗǝ tǝ kanda ahu hashmbe ɗǝm ƙǝmarha tǝ Chinǝm a fǝrakh amshi. Nǝm a tsaurha tǝ Chinǝm pakwanɗǝ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Kor 15:51-52</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Tsaunǝn kee nama a fǝrang kaali ndan aten laɓarɗi ya.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngwama fa ka ɓad Chinǝm ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nanǝnya shayina aten sayi nduwa fara na ǝnggini a katǝrarha hai ya, mbǝ ƙǝl nggǝr nan chireethleng kun ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Ƙǝsǝr kun tafad nun sǝnɗun sǝ a fara na Chinǝm a ɓarha ɓa nǝn naarha ƙǝla ɓad ngaara ɓa a fǝɗikrha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matta. 24:43, Luka. 12:39, 2Mbit. 3:10</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />A sayidɗi na fiya a ndaarha, “Nan a tsau ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ kwassa hura hai.” Kula sǝndǝndan sǝ ƙǝl ɓagha sǝsaarha a tendan ɓa kaan, mbǝ kwaman hǝrǝkrha sǝ wa, ƙǝla na hatta hur nggǝtta ƙǝsang nuneefa na ahur. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Amma kun shayina mbuwun hu wula wa, na ɗǝ farɗi wal kun ya kula sǝndǝnun sǝ ƙǝla ngaara. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ƙǝsǝr kun heu wangya kukwaryirha ni kun, yi yanfara ƙǝm. Ƙǝm mbǝ yi fǝɗikrha ni nduwa wula wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Tsaunǝn kee a shii ɗǝm ƙǝla na fingya ǝnaarha wa. Amma taama tsawum nggungwa fa nam a ƙǝlarha ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ƙǝsǝr fingya na a shiirha na nda ǝnaghǝn a fǝɗikrha, fingya ƙǝm a fǝɗikrha ndǝna mbaala tǝrang kanda in. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Amma tsaunǝn ƙǝm yi yanfara ni, taama ngwam fa, kal luwud ɗǝɓǝla nǝm yi fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ yi nggǝmnda, sheng teena nǝm walla hǝrǝkrha fa tsauka ndǝna tǝtar ɗǝɓǝl nǝm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ish, 59:17; Afisaya. 6:13-17</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Wurwa Faara ƙǝm ka a nagha sǝbgha hurghǝn aten nǝn wa, amma na midghǝn sǝ a wal hǝrǝkrha nǝm ahu Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Ndǝghǝn ni mǝrgha ka ƙǝm, ƙǝsǝr ko nanǝm tǝ yibrha fa, nduwa mǝr ɗǝm a fara wud nǝn ɓa, a tsawum tǝghǝn. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Tsaunǝn kee nama a fǝrang kaali ndan, non a ɗang ndan sǝ, ƙǝla nanun a ǝnaarha nanǝnya.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwalad mii yiyi thlǝmaarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Amma nan a hwan kun, shayinan, nama a fǝrang mamnggirha fingya na a ǝna taara kaan ahur nun, mamnggi nun ahu Chinǝm na a fǝrang laɓar Faara kun. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Fǝraman mamnggirha kanda ngga tǝ nggǝmnda ƙǝsǝr ka tar ndan. Tsawama ɗǝɗem tǝ ndan. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Nan a hwan kun shayinan, yana man fingya na sǝsahun, fǝraman kaali fingya na tǝ shilee yid. Ɗaman fingya sǝ mbuwa ƙǝkanglang. Ƙǝrsaama ƙǝm tǝ kowunni. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Kwarama nun ɗǝ nggǝrang mbǝlfeerha niifa sǝ tǝ mbǝlfeerha. A meyedghǝn ǝna man nggayirha ndan tǝ ƙǝm a kowunni. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ƙǝtsar nama tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />A malang ɗun hwan Faara wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Ko a huma ni usama Faara, ƙǝsǝr ǝnɗa na mid Faara a kun ˈyahu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />A ɓǝlang ɗun wad Sǝsǝn Faara hai wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />A sarɗun ˈya thlǝkna annabiya wa, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ƙǝƙǝraman ǝngya heu, ƙǝs fingya yina nun ha na ngga. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Malaman kala tur tar mbǝlfeerha.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwalad mii ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ngwa tsauka Faara tafadghǝn na a fǝr tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha, a tsaɓanggǝn kun ɗǝ heu non chahal. A laf sǝsǝn nun nǝn, tǝ yiɓǝd nun, tǝ fad nun heu, a tsawun nafiya mbuwa tǝ ɗimiyirha fa a fara na Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Yanɗi aagha kun nǝghǝn tǝ ƙǝkafek fa, nǝn a ǝnaghǝn. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Shayina, hwanaman Faara kan teena. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ndaman ˈya shayinǝm fa heu tǝ nggǝmnda yi fa takkwaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Hwanni kun tǝ thlǝm Chinǝm, karataman ɗeleewar ɗiya a fatakkwaya heu. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Ngwa tsauka nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ kun.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>